. The habit burger grill - a fast-casual chain with charbroiled burgers and fresh ingredients\n5. Smashburger - known for their juicy and flavorful burgers with unique toppings\n6. Burgerfi - a chain known for their all-natural angus beef burgers and eco-friendly practices\n7. Steak 'n shake - known for their classic steakburgers with thin and crispy fries\n8. Fuddruckers - a chain that lets you customize your own burgers with a variety of toppings and sauces\n9. Bobby's burger palace - a casual restaurant chain created by celebrity chef bobby flay with a variety of delicious burgers\n10. Red robin - a chain with a variety of burgers made with fresh ingredients and endless fries.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nDo you know any places with vegetarian options?<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nCertainly, here are a few places that offer vegetarian options:\n\n1. Subway - veggie-filled sandwiches\n2. Chipotle - Veggie bowls\n3. Blaze Pizza - a custom-built pizza that comes in a vegan option\n4. TGI Fridays - has a Beyond Burger which is made from plant-based ingredients\n5. Veggie Grill - a chain with a variety of vegetarian items such as veggie burgers, veggie wraps, and salads\n6. Panera Bread - you can find various vegetarian options in their menu, like soups, salads, and sandwiches. 7. Noodles and Company - with the option to pick from salads, pasta dishes, and tofu-filled soups and stews\n8. Pizza Hut - You can build your own pizza with a variety of fresh vegetables\n9. Wendy’s - Has an option of veggie burgers\n10. Taco Bell - Offers options such as black bean crunch wraps, and vegetarian-friendly beans, rice, and potatoes dishes.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nWow,","tokens":["<|im_start|>","system","\n","You"," are"," a"," helpful"," assistant",".","<|im_end|>","\n","<|im_start|>","user","\n","Do"," you"," have"," any"," recommendations"," for"," affordable"," restaurants"," in"," the"," area","?","<|im_end|>","\n","<|im_start|>","assistant","\n","I"," do"," not"," 